{
  "_about": "Grammar item bank. Each structure belongs to one CEFR level. Each item: id (unique), structure (key from 'structures'), q (sentence; ___ marks the gap), answer, distractors (exactly 3), optional en (English gloss, shown under the sentence), optional why (short rule, shown only in results). Add items freely: the adaptive engine uses 1 item per structure per level, then a 2nd item for structures you missed. 3+ items per structure lets retests rotate to unseen items. 'No sé' is added automatically. Variety: Latin American (ustedes, no vosotros).",
  "structures": {
